> > pure 32-bit and 64-bit cases but not for the mixed 32-bit/64-bit case,
> > it fails with "ALSA lib pcm_hw.c:549:(snd_pcm_hw_start)
> > SNDRV_PCM_IOCTL_START failed: Broken pipe":
